<tr id="S3.T1.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S3.T1.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row"><span id="S3.T1.2.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ours</span> (<a href="#S4" title="4 Schema Guided Coding Agents ‣ Dialogue-SWEBench: A Benchmark for Dialogue-Driven Coding Agents" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§ 4</span></a>)</th>
