<figure id="A1.F9" class="ltx_figure ltx_lstlisting ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span>System prompt used with our user LLM <math id="A1.F9.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{U}_{\phi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{U}_{\phi}</annotation></semantics></math> for self-revision. The LLM is tasked with finding violations in the candidate reply <math id="A1.F9.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{u}_{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{u}_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math>, which will then be revised in a final prompt for <math id="A1.F9.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{U}_{\phi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{U}_{\phi}</annotation></semantics></math>, before being returned as <math id="A1.F9.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math> to the agent</figcaption>
<div id="A1.F9.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing" style="--ltx-border-color:#000000;"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="listings/revision_check.txt">⬇</a></div>
